  "files": {},
  "metadata": {
    "title": "DPO learns directly from preference pairs",
    "description": "DPO derives a closed-form optimum for KL-regularized RLHF, inverts it into an implicit reward \u03b2 log(\u03c0\u03b8/\u03c0ref), and substitutes this into Bradley\u2013Terry preference loss. The partition term cancels, so DPO trains on offline preference pairs without a separate reward model or PPO loop."
  }
}
